# Deployment and operations

Containers
- app/Dockerfile: multi-stage, prisma generate with placeholder DATABASE_URL during build, final runner uses .output
- microservice/Dockerfile: multi-stage, prisma generate; special target runner-keyrotate for staging CronJob

Local services
- docker-compose.yaml: MySQL 8 and Redis with local ports; volumes and healthchecks configured
- .devcontainer/docker-compose.yml: devcontainer with MySQL/Redis services for Codespaces/devcontainers

CI/CD (GitHub Actions)
- .github/workflows/pr.yml (PRs)
  - Lint, tests (with generated Prisma client), pre-commit security (TruffleHog, hooks), CodeQL
  - If PR branch is from this repo, build/push images to gcr.io and deploy to staging via .deploy manifests, then verify rollout and /health/ready
  - Posts a Bugbot run comment (optional)
- .github/workflows/main.yml (default branch)
  - Build/push app and microservice images to gcr.io
  - Deploy to production GKE using .deploy action and verify public health
- .github/workflows/codeql.yml and sonar.yml: security and static analysis

Kubernetes
- .deploy/dineros.template.yaml: envsubst-rendered manifest including
  - Namespace, Deployments (main app and microservice), Services, Ingress
  - Secrets are referenced via envFrom and secretKeyRef (DATABASE_URL, JWT, Plaid, Postmark, INTERNAL_API_TOKEN, Redis host/port, etc.)
  - SecurityContext set to runAsNonRoot UID 1001; readiness/liveness/startup probes hit HTTP 80 paths /health/ready and /health/live
  - MICROSERVICE_INTERNAL_URL provided to main app
- .deploy/key-rotation-cronjob.template.yaml and key-rotation-rbac.template.yaml
  - Staging-only nightly DB field-encryption key rotation and microservice migrate trigger; requires RBAC Role/RoleBinding and appropriate GKE IAM for apply

Runtime configuration
- Environment validated in app/server/envSchema.ts (Zod)
- Health endpoints mounted at /health/ready and /health/live
- Logging: server/logger.ts and service-specific logging; GCP logging wiring via GCLOUD_KEY_NAME and GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS

Agent/cloud notes
- AGENTS.md documents Cursor Cloud specifics: start system MySQL and Redis, override DATABASE_URL injected secret, test behavior

Release safety
- Ensure prisma migrations are applied (CI deploy uses migrate deploy in image build/runtime where needed)
- Verify probes and /health readiness before routing traffic (deployment job does an extra verification script)
